# Web API Standards

## Routing & Versioning
**Pattern:** `api/v{version}/[controller]/[action]`
**Versioning:** URL-based versioning
**Actions:** RESTful verbs (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE)

## Request/Response
**Request:** DTOs with validation attributes
**Response:** `{ success: bool, data: T, message: string, errors: string[] }`
**Status Codes:** 200 (OK), 201 (Created), 400 (Bad Request), 401 (Unauthorized), 404 (Not Found), 500 (Server Error)
**Folders:** DTOs in `/Requests` & `/Responses`. Entities in `/Entities`

## Security & Reliability
**Authentication:** JWT Bearer tokens/OAuth2
**Authorization:** Policy-based with claims
**CORS:** Configured for frontend domains
**Idempotency:** POST operations with idempotency keys

## Integration
**Backend Logic:** Implemented in `@dev/rules/stack/backend.md` services
**Data Models:** DTOs from `@dev/rules/stack/data.md`
**Frontend Consumption:** Contracts for `@dev/rules/stack/frontend.md`